==English==
[[File:Djibouti w2 locator.svg|thumb|right|Djibouti]]

===Etymology===
{{unk|en}}; the country of Djibouti was named after its capital city. Multiple theories exist as to the origin of the lemma, including derivation from {{der|en|aa|gabouti||plate}} or {{m|aa|gabood||plateau}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/d͡ʒɪˈbuːtiː/}}
* {{rhymes|en|uːti|s=3}}
* {{audio|en|En-Djibouti-pronunciation.ogg|a=US}}

